WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.837
Lab 2 uses a test tenant, never
production; the authors haven't run it.

2
00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:06.626
Export with a read-only app,

3
00:00:06.626 --> 00:00:11.176
and run the member-of scan beside
Learn's script: the lists must match.

4
00:00:11.176 --> 00:00:15.682
Create one policy from a copy of the
program's file, with a one-hour grace,

5
00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:19.800
linted first and sent by an
Identity Governance Administrator.

6
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.042
Move a test user through
the pipeline, never by hand,

7
00:00:23.042 --> 00:00:26.362
with the validation kit's
snapshot before and after.

8
00:00:26.362 --> 00:00:30.801
Run the residual, give the sheet to the
test manager, and measure the interval.

9
00:00:30.801 --> 00:00:32.330
Then back everything out.
